# Recovery kits carry the account signing and KEM secret keys (encrypted under
# the master key) and the master key itself wrapped under a PIN. A PIN is four
# characters at minimum, which is hours of offline Argon2id — so a kit in a repo
# is the vault. One was committed here on 2026-08-07; never again.
